<title>UK: Transco UK gas forecasts for May 22.</title>
<headline>Transco UK gas forecasts for May 22.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-05-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Transco, the pipeline and transport arm of BG plc has announced the following forecasts and data for UK natural gas consumption in the period May 20 to 22.</p>
<p>DEMAND:</p>
<p>(mcm = million cubic metres)</p>
<p>May 20 (actual) 167 mcm, 39 percent of peak day demand</p>
<p>May 21 (forecast) 190 mcm, 44 percent of peak day demand</p>
<p>May 22 (forecast) 194 mcm, 45 percent of peak day demand</p>
<p>TEMPERATURE:</p>
<p>(SNT = seasonal normal temperature)</p>
<p>May 20 (actual) 12.9 Celsius, SNT 13.4 Celsius</p>
<p>May 21 (forecast) 10.2 Celsius, SNT 13.5 Celsius</p>
<p>May 22 (forecast) 10.1 Celsius, SNT 13.6 Celsius</p>
<p>--London Newsroom, +44 171 542 6412</p>
</text>
